{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"七旬翁西貢踏單車暈倒送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/COLLAP-SK-261119-21.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】一名71歲男子在西貢踏單車時暈倒送院。</p><p>飛行服務隊直升機將男子送往東區醫院急症室，醫護人員沿途急救，男子暫無生命危險，留院觀察。</p><p>據了解，該男子與朋友由西沙GO PARK騎單車到深涌營地，當駛近深涌碼頭時，他身體不適暈倒，從單車倒地。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:58:12.486092+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:24:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:13.034270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:40.596493+00:00","content_hash":"1076675f7a0d4c4d93ea19df07bf221d4c1ff82dde7a281e6411291f0d0cb9bf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:58:12.486092+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}